  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.\n• Halve chat potatoes.\n• Spread potatoes over a large microwave-safe plate. Cover with a damp paper towel. Microwave potatoes on high, 3 minutes.\n• Drain any excess liquid, then place potatoes on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil, season with salt and toss to coat.\n• Spread out evenly, then roast until golden and tender, 10-15 minutes.\n• Meanwhile, finely chop celery.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67dce4c27594446a7cdcb4cd/step-9f731d00.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat enough olive oil to coat base over medium-high heat.\n• Cook plant-based crumbed chicken until golden and heated through, 2-3 minutes on each side.\n• Transfer to a paper towel-lined plate.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67dce4c27594446a7cdcb4cd/step-4b009e10.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a medium heatproof bowl, combine gravy granules and the boiling water (1/2 cup for 2 people / 1 cup for 4 people), whisking until smooth, 1 minute.\n• Stir through wholegrain mustard until combined. Season to taste with salt and pepper.\n• Add dill & parsley mayonnaise to the tray with roasted potatoes and toss to combine. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67dce4c27594446a7cdcb4cd/step-f2b40e20.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large bowl, combine the honey and a drizzle of vinegar and olive oil. Season. Add celery and mixed salad leaves and toss to combine.\n• Slice plant-based crumbed chicken.\n• Divide plant-based crumbed chicken, dill-parsley potatoes and celery salad between plates. Serve with mustard gravy. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67dce4c27594446a7cdcb4cd/step-4669e530.jpg"
    }
  ]
